Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part A}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.11,0:00:13.28,Main,Botan,0,0,0,,One, two, one, two, one, two...{9x 1,2, in total}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.28,0:00:15.66,Main,Botan,0,0,0,,Mm-hm, \N you’re all starting to get in sync.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.66,0:00:17.58,Main,Botan,0,0,0,,All right, let’s have a break!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.08,0:00:21.25,Main,Them,0,0,0,,{\i1}Starrific work!{\i0}{otsukaresamadesutar}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:22.21,0:00:25.09,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Starrific work!{otsukaresamadesutar}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.67,0:00:31.47,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,You did great too, Metamon! \N Betcha can’t wait for the real thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.22,0:00:33.93,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.52,0:00:36.93,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,What’re these?{~~Sword and Shield, you're too young to know them~~}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.52,0:00:39.52,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Props for the parade?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.06,0:00:41.69,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Wah, they moved!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.40,0:00:47.11,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Did they scare you? \N Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.11,0:00:50.20,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Those are Hitotsuki and Doumirror. \N They’re our Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.20,0:00:52.07,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Huh? Pokémon?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.74,0:00:55.87,Main,Botan,0,0,0,,A sword and mirror \N people once used in the past.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.87,0:00:58.83,Main,Botan,0,0,0,,Some Pokémon are born from objects{things}.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.58,0:01:03.08,Main,Student,0,0,0,,When people form emotional ties to objects{things}, \N life comes to inhabit them.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.08,0:01:07.67,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming to stay with me! \N I’ll treasure you all the more, ‘kay?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.67,0:01:10.38,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Pokémon born from objects{things}, huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.38,0:01:12.43,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,That sounds fun!
Comment: 0,0:01:12.43,0:01:12.43,Main,,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:42.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part B}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.53,0:02:55.78,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,You lot... First and foremost, \N I’m glad you’re safe.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.24,0:02:57.53,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,They were so strong...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.07,0:03:03.20,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,{\q2\t(4529,5030,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}It looked like an Ice type, \N but Loudbone’s fire didn’t work on the ice it sent out.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.70,0:03:07.88,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,{\t(3570,4071,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}Kairyu was flyin’, but that thing went and hit it \N with something that was like a {\i1}Ground{\i0} move!{Dread Kairyu}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.88,0:03:11.21,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wanival had his stamina \N sucked out all at once.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.21,0:03:13.88,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,{\t(2066,2567,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}That was no ordinary \N leaf or wind attack.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.88,0:03:18.01,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Guren'arma’s Kindled Fire \N couldn’t absorb its flames.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.01,0:03:20.26,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,{\t(1648,2148,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}I couldn’t do a thing...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.81,0:03:23.02,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Their strengths are \N an unknown quantity.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.02,0:03:26.02,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Even what little you learned \N is a good haul.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.48,0:03:29.65,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Though it’s still unbelievable \N that the shrines were unsealed...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.11,0:03:32.40,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Just what are those Pokémon?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.48,0:03:34.69,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,I’ll fill you in.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.11,0:03:39.37,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,They’re Pokémon once referred to \N as “Calamities.”
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.91,0:03:41.20,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Chóngjian.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.91,0:03:41.20,Main,pinyin,0,0,0,,{\fscx\fscy40\alpha&HFF&}{\fscx70\alpha\pos(1052,987)}v{\fscx\alpha&HFF&}.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.20,0:03:44.37,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Said to endlessly suck \N the energy from plants.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.75,0:03:46.12,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Bàojiàn.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.12,0:03:49.13,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Story goes that it can control \N hundred-ton snowfalls.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.13,0:03:50.59,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Dinglù.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.13,0:03:50.59,Main,pinyin,0,0,0,,{\fscx\fscy40\alpha&HFF&}{\fscx70\alpha\pos(917,989)}v{\fscx\alpha&HFF&}.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.59,0:03:54.51,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Apparently the fissures{same word as the move Fissure} it creates \N can be fifty meters deep.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.92,0:03:56.09,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Yùyú.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.09,0:03:59.51,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Supposedly controls \N 3,000-degree flames at will.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.51,0:04:04.64,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,They were sealed away long ago, \N as dangerous beings that bring disaster.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.64,0:04:07.52,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,So the disasters were Pokémon...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.52,0:04:11.27,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,There had been old stakes \N driven in near the shrines...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.27,0:04:14.03,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,But I saw one pulled out, \N lying on the ground.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.03,0:04:17.78,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Those stakes were there \N to seal them inside the shrines.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.78,0:04:21.53,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Those former Explorers guys \N pulled ‘em out!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.53,0:04:24.91,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,But didn’t you mention \N that someone {\i1}hired{\i0} them to?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.91,0:04:30.42,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,We don’t know whether there’s someone \N behind them pulling the strings...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.42,0:04:31.63,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.13,0:04:34.67,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Ms. Raifort?{sensei}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.38,0:04:36.38,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.38,0:04:38.26,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Wahoo!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.26,0:04:41.30,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Pokémon from a bygone era, {\i1}revived!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.30,0:04:43.39,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,I wanna see ‘em! I wanna see ‘em!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.39,0:04:46.02,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,I won’t get a chance like this again!{148}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.02,0:04:47.14,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,U-Uhh...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.14,0:04:50.35,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Didn’t you say they bring disaster...?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.35,0:04:51.65,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.52,0:04:56.15,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,They also appear in a folktale \N of the Kingdom of Paldea.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.48,0:04:58.03,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,The Kingdom of Paldea...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.03,0:05:02.03,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Please, tell us more \N about those Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.83,0:05:11.54,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“There was once a time where \N a vast kingdom ruled the lands of Paldea.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.92,0:05:16.55,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“Its king took great delight \N in collecting the treasures of other lands.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.09,0:05:23.80,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,{\q2}“One day, a merchant from the East visited his castle, \N and showed the king four treasures.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.22,0:05:30.18,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,{\q2}“The king, overjoyed, gave him a fortune in gold coins \N and acquired the treasures for himself.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.60,0:05:35.27,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“That very night, black clouds \N suddenly formed above the castle,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.27,0:05:38.40,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“with a raging storm \N and hailstones soon following.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.94,0:05:40.78,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“The storm grew into a hurricane,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.78,0:05:44.99,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“breached the castle walls, \N and sucked up the four treasures.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.45,0:05:53.46,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,{\q2}“Amidst the storm, as the vessel was enveloped by earth, \N the sword by ice, the beads by flame, and the tablets by leaves, {close-to-TL-alt: “Amidst the storm, when earth enveloped the vessel, \N ice the sword, flames the beads, and leaves the tablets,}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.00,0:05:57.25,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“the treasures transformed \N into four Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.21,0:06:02.63,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“They leapt out from the castle, \N and began rampaging all across Paldea.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.26,0:06:09.64,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,{\q2}“Their homes, villages, and fields having been put to ruin \N by the Pokémon, the populace swarmed the castle. {“The people descended upon the castle, their homes, villages, and fields having been ruined by the Pokémon.}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.18,0:06:13.85,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“The flustered king sent \N the soldiers in his castle to face them.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.35,0:06:19.65,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“But the four Pokémon were ferocious, \N and repelled them to the last.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.57,0:06:22.65,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“The king was at his wits’ end.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.20,0:06:30.04,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,{\q2}“It was then the king heard rumors that \N a very strong Pokémon tamer was visiting from a distant land.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.54,0:06:36.04,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“Thus, he summoned {that person}him to the castle, \N and implored him to exterminate the four.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.54,0:06:42.05,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“With his Pokémon companions in tow, \N the Pokémon tamer left to meet with the four.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.67,0:06:49.43,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“The battle lasted three days and three nights \N before he, at last, managed to defeat the four.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.77,0:06:52.98,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“The Pokémon tamer told the king thus:{The Pokemon controller said this:}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.98,0:06:56.06,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“‘Those four were born \N from a curse laid upon the treasures.’
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.06,0:06:59.82,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“‘They should be sealed away, \N such that they never return to life.’
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.48,0:07:04.15,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“And thus, the king built \N grand shrines for them.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.70,0:07:08.24,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“The four would never awaken again,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.24,0:07:11.24,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“and peace came to Paldea.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.83,0:07:14.33,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,“All’s well that ends well.”
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.33,0:07:17.71,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,So that’s the legend \N told about those Pokémon...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.71,0:07:22.25,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Meaning their fearsome reputation \N has been passed down to this very day.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.25,0:07:23.96,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,But what made them go on a rampage...?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.96,0:07:24.51,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.51,0:07:26.80,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Must’ve had {\i1}some{\i0} reason, yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.80,0:07:30.35,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,As the book says, \N it was likely the treasures’ curse.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.35,0:07:34.27,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,But you never know \N whether legends really are true.{152}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.27,0:07:38.60,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Yeah. We’ve gotta find out \N the truth ourselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.69,0:07:43.65,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Honestly... \N You lot are right on the money, there!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.65,0:07:46.86,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,You never know how much truth \N lies behind a fable.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.86,0:07:50.95,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,But what we {\i1}do{\i0} know for sure is that \N those four possess tremendous power.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.95,0:07:53.49,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,We felt as much in our battles.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.49,0:07:57.33,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,I plan to continue \N my research on them.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.75,0:08:02.75,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Still, objects turnin’ into Pokémon, \N that’s mega-strange.{fushigi}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.75,0:08:08.93,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,It’s like with my Surfugo. \N A soul came to dwell in coins once used by people.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.93,0:08:13.85,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Our feelings can rub off \N on treasured objects, and so bring life.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.85,0:08:20.27,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,{\q2}On the other hand... Pokémon like Jupetta, \N born from the grudges of stuffed toys discarded by kids...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.27,0:08:22.69,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,...may be a closer comparison \N to those four.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.57,0:08:25.74,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Welcome back, guys!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.74,0:08:26.69,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Navi?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.49,0:08:32.49,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,So? Lovely, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.37,0:08:36.20,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,That’s sweet!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.20,0:08:37.16,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,It looks great on you!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.16,0:08:37.87,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.87,0:08:39.42,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, watch this!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.42,0:08:42.63,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Metamon’s going to \N put on a show in the parade!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.96,0:08:45.92,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Metamon’s incredible!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.38,0:08:51.34,Main,Botan,0,0,0,,It didn’t take long to make friends \N with our Pokémon and all.{dashi}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.64,0:08:54.76,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Look forward to the parade!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.26,0:08:57.98,Main,Navi,0,0,0,,Botan! Let’s go back to Shuumei \N and the others!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.98,0:08:58.68,Main,Botan,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.19,0:09:06.19,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Best to avoid causing her \N unnecessary worry, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.19,0:09:10.32,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Right. We’ll figure out a way \N to handle the Calamity Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.49,Main,Liko Dot,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.32,0:09:11.49,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.70,0:09:17.50,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Really think we’d let you \N whup us and run?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.50,0:09:20.04,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,You totally rare Pokémon are fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.04,0:09:22.50,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,I’ve been bored outta my mind \N for a li’l while!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.50,0:09:24.67,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Time to play, Onipurin!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.42,0:09:26.63,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Play Rough!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.01,0:09:33.51,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.43,0:09:41.06,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Onipurin, \N show it your fighting spirit!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.57,0:09:55.37,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Huh? Onipurin!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.87,0:09:59.12,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Hey, jerk! \N Gimme back my Onipurin!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.12,0:10:00.87,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,I’m comin’ to your rescue now, ‘kay?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.87,0:10:03.87,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Being walked straight past \N doesn’t sit well with me, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.87,0:10:06.17,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Onigohri! Blizzard!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.63,0:10:10.26,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Kyojiohn! Salt Pickling!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.05,0:10:17.64,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Awright!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.64,0:10:23.64,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Hrrn! Heave-ho! Hmmh! Hah! Hyah!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.82,0:10:29.90,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Onipurin!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.99,0:10:38.08,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,What’re you lookin’ at! \N Don’t think you can just waltz away!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.08,0:10:40.37,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Onigohri! Ice Spinner!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.25,0:10:48.88,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Argh! What’s your {\i1}deal{\i0} already?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.01,0:10:52.55,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.73,0:11:06.56,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.19,0:11:10.07,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Ahh, Onigohri!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.73,0:11:13.61,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,I’m so glad you got outta that thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.61,0:11:15.70,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,What a relief...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.28,0:11:18.82,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,{\an8}Though it took a lot outta me...{It's a relief even despite that[having to go through all that]}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.91,0:11:18.82,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.82,0:11:21.16,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,It’s an inadequate apology, \N but please eat these.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.16,0:11:24.91,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,I don’t know much about you, \N but I’m sure you get hungry, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.46,0:11:33.59,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Ugh, that was the {\i1}worst.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.59,0:11:35.05,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,A stroke of misfortune.{sainan is another word for disaster, but he goes wazawai? later so having both as disaster would be odd :s}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.05,0:11:36.84,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,I’ve had enough. I’m beat.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.84,0:11:40.47,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Let’s just get our reward already, \N and then go buy some limited-supply sweets.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.47,0:11:41.18,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Waah!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.35,0:11:44.93,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.56,0:11:47.06,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Quite a streak of misfortune.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.06,0:11:48.81,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Shut it! Gimme a hand.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.78,0:11:56.82,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,What are you two playing at?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.82,0:11:59.74,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,We met an unexpected delay, \N but we’re heading back to you now.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.74,0:12:01.45,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Onyx!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.45,0:12:05.33,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,You haven’t seen a peculiar Pokémon \N near the shrine, have you?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.33,0:12:08.42,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,It’d have four legs and \N something like a vessel atop its head...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.42,0:12:10.58,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Oh, that thing just wandered off.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.58,0:12:15.13,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,Wh-What did you say? \N So its seal really {\i1}has{\i0} come undone...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.13,0:12:17.55,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Seal? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.55,0:12:19.30,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,The other shrines are the same.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.30,0:12:25.72,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,{\q2}By pulling out the stakes, \N the four Calamity Pokémon sealed long ago have awakened.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.72,0:12:27.94,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,Disaster will befall Paldea.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.94,0:12:28.73,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.73,0:12:29.81,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.81,0:12:32.19,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,So they’d been \N locked in there for ages?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.19,0:12:35.40,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,I can’t sit around here. \N I need to hurry and do something...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.40,0:12:37.15,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Disaster?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.03,0:12:40.95,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Whaddaya want?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.95,0:12:42.24,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,How ridiculous.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.24,0:12:44.41,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,To believe in the superstitions \N of the past...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.20,0:12:46.41,Main,Onyx,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.58,0:12:50.87,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,Disaster’s befallen you!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:54.21,0:12:56.80,Main,Sango,0,0,0,,So there’s four totally rare Pokémon...
Comment: 0,0:13:03.47,0:13:03.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Part C}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.39,0:13:12.48,Main,Caster,0,0,0,,Inexplicable events are occurring \N at many spots around Paldea.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.36,0:13:16.48,Main,Caster,0,0,0,,The causes behind \N each of these events are unknown.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.48,0:13:18.74,Main,Student,0,0,0,,Hey, you think things’ll be okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.74,0:13:21.36,Main,Student,0,0,0,,They won’t cancel \N the school festival, will they?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.36,0:13:24.74,Main,Caster,0,0,0,,The nature of the damage \N differs from zone to zone,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.74,0:13:27.12,Main,Caster,0,0,0,,with the marks left \N at the sites also varying...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.12,0:13:29.83,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Not good. \N The damage is spreading.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.83,0:13:35.50,Main,Caster,0,0,0,,Restoration work is underway in a nearby city, \N with help from Exceed.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.50,0:13:38.51,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,We’ll handle this \N with the utmost expediency.{We'll deal with it as fast as we can. But in a formal register, whereas that sounds pretty blase rendered in English directly.}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.05,0:13:40.13,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Amethio!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.13,0:13:43.26,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,If you find yourself in any trouble, \N please contact us.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.26,0:13:46.14,Main,Amethio,0,0,0,,We will protect the safety of Paldea.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:46.68,0:13:48.35,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Looks like this might all work out!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.35,0:13:50.39,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,We have to stop \N the Calamity Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.39,0:13:53.44,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yeah. \N We can’t just leave them to run wild.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.44,0:13:55.65,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Where exactly are they?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.65,0:13:58.82,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,If I plot the damage \N by the time of occurrence,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.82,0:14:01.28,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,we should see the routes \N they each{the four} took.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.91,0:14:03.91,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.91,0:14:04.53,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.91,0:14:09.33,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Looks like the damage is leading \N from the shrines to the center of Paldea.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.33,0:14:10.91,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Meanin’ what?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.21,0:14:16.09,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,And these are the likely current positions \N for each of them{the four}.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.09,0:14:18.55,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,They’re all heading \N to meet up in Table City.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.13,0:14:23.68,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,I’ve heard the Kingdom of Paldea’s castle \N was in Table City!{...It was? Games say the Academy existed before the Empire fell, so where was the castle if the Academy was in the middle of the table?}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.68,0:14:27.76,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,So then, they want to take out \N their grudges on the king?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.76,0:14:33.44,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hold on, that king ain’t around anymore, \N and neither is that Kingdom of Paldea thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.44,0:14:35.81,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,But {\i1}they{\i} don’t know that.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.81,0:14:39.32,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,If four Pokémon that strong \N gather together...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.86,0:14:42.15,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,If we don’t do something, \N Orange Academy’s in danger.{PV}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.90,0:14:45.03,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,The school festival \N they all put together...{Everyone's school festival will be...}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.03,0:14:48.28,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Navi and the others \N are looking forward to the parade!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.28,0:14:50.54,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,We need to stop those four!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.95,0:14:51.75,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.75,0:14:53.66,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,And I want to know...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.66,0:14:56.38,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,...how the Calamity Pokémon \N really feel.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.38,0:14:57.21,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Liko...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.21,0:14:58.29,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,When I battled that one,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.00,0:15:02.38,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I felt like it wasn’t even \N looking at me and Masquernya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.76,0:15:05.26,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Wasn’t looking at you? \N What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.26,0:15:08.64,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Even though we were facing each other, \N it was as if it didn’t care about me...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.64,0:15:12.14,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I getcha. \N Same thing happened on my end.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.14,0:15:16.52,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,So I want to face it eye to eye, \N as a Pokémon Trainer!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.52,0:15:18.52,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,I want to know all about Yùyú.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.52,0:15:20.40,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,You said it, Liko.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.86,0:15:22.78,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,We’re up against unknown Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.19,0:15:26.11,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,There’s no point in sittin’ here \N and comin’ up with a plan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.11,0:15:28.99,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Let’s find a solution while we battle!{PV}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.99,0:15:34.00,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,{\q2}Got it. When you encounter them, \N connect your Smartphone Rotom video feeds to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.00,0:15:35.00,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.00,0:15:36.92,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,I bid you all good luck.{not kisama-tachi/you lot}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.39,0:15:58.90,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Not the wild Pokémon, too...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.90,0:16:00.86,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Time to save them, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.08,0:16:12.99,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.63,0:16:21.38,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Don’t give in! \N Keep your strength up!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.01,0:16:34.81,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Dekanuchan! Surfugo!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.31,0:16:37.43,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,No way... \N Just like that...?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.91,0:16:56.20,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Loudbone! Stomping Tantrum!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.47,0:17:14.93,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,It’s nothing to fear! Get ready!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.43,0:17:20.64,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Taikaiden, fly off with Lucario!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:20.64,0:17:22.31,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Loudbone, one more Stomping Tantrum!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.65,0:17:29.74,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Infight!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.83,0:17:45.46,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Here it comes! On your guard!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.59,0:17:51.59,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Taikaiden!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.06,0:18:07.07,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.94,0:18:10.86,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,You’re gonna battle me! \N And this time I’ll win!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.70,0:18:15.07,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Uh, hey! So don’t {\i1}ignore{\i0} me!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.49,0:18:17.08,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.58,0:18:19.95,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Stop, stop, stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.37,0:18:23.62,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.71,0:18:28.71,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Hey! Who did it?! \N Who’s been diggin’ pits out here?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.92,0:18:34.22,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I’ll get ya to turn around \N no matter what.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.55,0:18:38.43,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,That’s it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.43,0:18:40.14,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Yamirami! Power Gem!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.65,0:18:48.77,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,If I can block its path...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.44,0:18:49.94,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.57,0:18:52.94,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Look out!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.45,0:18:58.70,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,It can do that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.54,0:19:04.66,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Kairyu!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.59,0:19:13.92,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Phew, saved me there...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.92,0:19:16.13,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,But ya finally turned and faced me!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.77,0:19:33.03,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Everyone, \N let’s combine our strengths!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.78,0:19:43.16,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Focus! Watch it closely!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:47.04,0:19:49.17,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Brimuon! \N Stop the attack with Mind Power!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.55,0:19:58.64,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya, grab it with your vine!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.73,0:20:09.06,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Then Guren'arma, \N use Fire Vortex!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.11,0:20:19.11,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.58,0:20:26.50,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Guren'arma!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.17,0:20:35.67,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Thank you. Have a good rest.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.89,0:20:50.02,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,As I thought, \N they won’t be going down easy...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.06,0:20:52.61,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,Mr. Hokkora, sir!{sensei}{I hate it. "Drop the Mr." wouldn't make any sense and would really fuck up any Hokkora-sans that get rendered as Mr. Hokkora (which has already happened). We'd have to use Professor (undesirable), or sir, or some kind of flub... argh. -ed}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.61,0:20:55.40,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,Drop the formality. \N I’m retired from teaching.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.40,0:20:58.99,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,But you taught me so much, sir.{sensei}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.15,0:20:58.99,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hrm?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.53,0:21:03.16,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,Truly a shock... \N So they really {\i1}have{\i0} been revived...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.78,0:21:07.37,Main,Raifort,0,0,0,,You were studying the sealed shrines, \N weren’t you, sir?{sensei}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.37,0:21:11.04,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,We can talk later. \N For now, we mustn’t allow them to meet up.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.04,0:21:15.05,Main,Hokkora,0,0,0,,I don’t want to burden them \N with any {\i1}more{\i0} human ire{hatred}.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.39,0:21:24.80,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Guren'arma’s fire hasn’t let up yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.80,0:21:27.56,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Masquernya and Brimuon \N won’t waste this opportunity!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.85,0:21:31.44,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Yeah, Wanival!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.44,0:21:34.61,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Facing strong foes \N always gets me pumped up!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.48,0:21:37.69,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,Time to really cut loose!
Comment: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:45.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie A}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.74,0:21:48.33,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Friede here!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.33,0:21:51.92,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s time to Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.00,0:21:54.83,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Today’s topic is Yùyú!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:54.83,0:21:58.05,Main,Friede,0,0,20,,A Legendary Pokémon \N that controls super-hot flames.{Same as last week save for what it controls}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.05,0:22:02.38,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Apparently, it originally took a different form, \N but do you know which one?{Almost the same as last week, except without sore ga before the nani ka wakarukai}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.18,0:22:06.47,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,See the answer after the commercials!
Comment: 0,0:22:06.47,0:22:06.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{Ending}
Comment: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:36.48,Main,,0,0,0,,{Mega-Study With Instructor Starmie B}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.40,0:23:42.32,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,Time to announce \N the correct answer!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:42.32,0:23:43.86,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,The answer is...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.86,0:23:45.74,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,C: Curved beads!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.74,0:23:48.62,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,It’s said the jealousy \N that gathered within the treasure...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:48.62,0:23:50.70,Main,Friede,0,0,0,,...clad itself in fire \N and became a Pokémon!
Comment: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.67,0:24:03.38,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,We’re gonna stop those four!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:03.38,0:24:05.30,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,We have to protect Orange Academy!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:05.30,0:24:07.80,Main,Ult,0,0,0,,I’ll beat Dinglù, \N and make it approve of me!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:05.30,0:24:07.80,Main,pinyin,0,0,0,,{\fscx\fscy40\alpha&HFF&}I’ll beat {\fscx70\alpha\pos(917,906)}v{\fscx\alpha&HFF&},
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.84,0:24:12.06,Main,Dot,0,0,0,,Chóngjian... \N You might be more fun than I thought!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.84,0:24:12.06,Main,pinyin,0,0,0,,{\fscx\fscy40\alpha&HFF&}{\fscx70\alpha\pos(1052,904)}v{\fscx\alpha&HFF&}...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.43,0:24:16.23,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Bàojiàn... You’re so strong! \N I’m getting fired up!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.52,0:24:20.23,Main,Liko,0,0,0,,Yùyú... \N Tell me more about yourself!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:21.23,0:24:24.32,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,And so, to be continued \N next time on Pocket Monsters!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:24.32,0:24:26.95,Main,Roy,0,0,0,,Paldea in Calamity ―Reunion
Dialogue: 10,0:24:28.91,0:24:30.24,Main,Liko Roy,0,0,0,,It’s you...?!{lit. You(plural) are...?!}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.43,0:01:15.56,OP,,0,0,0,,{=62}{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}Ready, set, and... GO! READY! GO!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:18.27,OP,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}We’re in top-notch mode
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.27,0:01:21.23,OP,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(960,28)\blur5\bord7\c&HB7CB39&\3c&HB7CB39&\4c&HB7CB39&\xshad6\yshad3}You’re not alone, you know?
